{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "432c4fcb893611da8e0d33b1885c1a8fd10e165c62b084403679fcd29d8e42d7", "ja": "蝶と蝶", "zh": "蝶与蝶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2cd663ba878f5e01e18acc72616c374fe31d80667bb436d38bfdf6c3c4893468", "ja": "新曲を任される美希とエレナ。しかし、\nプロデューサーは出張が重なり不在がちに\nなると告げる。落ち込む美希を見て心配\nするエレナだったが、公演メンバー達の\n力を借りてある作戦に乗り出すことに。", "zh": "美希和艾琳娜接下了新曲的任务。然而，制作人告知她们，由于出差接踵而至，自己将经常不在。看到情绪低落的美希，艾琳娜十分担心，但她决定借助公演成员们的力量，实施某个作战计划。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b54781f9ff6e756be3609979258110bbe31a51ff69787c10274b9e71e13fde77", "ja": "（さて、新曲公演の段取りを進めていかないと。\n今日は早速、劇場公演のメンバーとミーティングだ！）", "zh": "（好了，得推进新歌公演的安排了。今天就先和剧场公演的成员们开个会吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "d275c9943440460fd9a44a8601e93f4cc0b4aaf537afc6ff29927a3a0e331446", "ja": "というわけで、この曲をエレナと美希に\n歌ってもらいたいんだけど……どうだろう？", "zh": "所以，我想让艾蕾娜和美希来唱这首歌……你们觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "beca8e1cf636e295ff6d5a023cefb659b28d059940b562fed9cfbb24a6f76c69", "ja": "ワォ！　すっごく、セクシーな曲だネ！\nこういうダンスミュージック、大好きだヨ～！", "zh": "哇！这首歌也太性感了吧！\n我最喜欢这种舞曲了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "9f975e91c5424868868dffa5054d8bc543e5e154b2f598aadd861483681c08f3", "ja": "それに、ミキとデュオっていうのも\nすっごく楽しみ！　ミキは？", "zh": "而且能和美希组成双人组合，也让我特别期待！美希呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "807441b809db3ab92a640f087f3f90aed43c21c28e9136aca4cd21bfdd329349", "ja": "うん、いいと思う。ミキ、こういう曲\nすっごく上手にできちゃうと思うな♪", "zh": "嗯，我觉得挺好的。美希觉得自己能把这种歌唱得特别棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "0f23f0a5e59d525d7e12dccc665d42f94da32df96c44256266335933e451a764", "ja": "ミキ、{$P$}を\nメロメロにしちゃうくらい、がんばるから♪", "zh": "我会努力到让{$P$}为我神魂颠倒哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "7cf7a3a64b7932ae7aee6c6723d775598545298a6c778a4430577844557a9b12", "ja": "だからミキと、\nずーっといっしょにいてね？", "zh": "所以，要一直一直和美希在一起哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "030b41f609f352d3620e364f28054c3e3039cbbc2ba02a47a2adf145cd904ca5", "ja": "いや、ずっとってわけにはいかなくて……。\n先のツアーの準備もあるし。", "zh": "不，没法一直陪着你……还得准备接下来的巡演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "e0a75f87e7b6b49d1b557791de1a1e99119efc24a6b660225266b705eb6cf159", "ja": "えー！？", "zh": "咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6cc07ac83302c2971217058a96c1215ac4b283d22dbf586824641704c05b639c", "ja": "いろいろな会場を見に行ったり、現地での\n打ち合わせとか……出張が立て込んじゃってな。", "zh": "要去考察各种各样的会场，还有去当地\n开会什么的……出差全都扎堆了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "29ce0190c55512a49f6f303c2e4e0fc982c64410478beb393daae7bab25b49f4", "ja": "ちょっとバタバタするとは思うけど……でも、\n美希とエレナなら、任せても大丈夫だろうと思って。", "zh": "虽然可能会有点忙乱……不过，我觉得交给美希和艾蕾娜应该没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "3cd6ad4eb0bbcbc631c7269ad34307e59202ea92ea12a08408d5a1312d1b3331", "ja": "そういうことなの……。\nはぁ……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊……  \n唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "1d61857f3c2cbeec3a6b3c596c18256e004f7001520db6a35b8d9cdc80cbe259", "ja": "がんばろうね、ミキ♪", "zh": "一起加油吧，美希♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "2a18aada8ac20eaf0163f1b14eb3ea91a20bd88369494540093cd6a8dde98c29", "ja": "それで、私たちは劇場公演のメンバーってわけね。\nうんうん、確かにベストな人選だわ！", "zh": "也就是说，我们是剧场公演的成员喽。\n嗯嗯，确实是最佳人选呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1015_033sih", "source_sha256": "0b98fcde9cf8d3fcb549ab33104a123dd1991ef510f73ab264e5c9dadcb48b05", "ja": "ベストな人選……私たちが、ですか？", "zh": "最佳人选……说的是我们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "2e5599aec1b508404c2bbc21a327bdfe440a8c6c3d2e22fccfca1c1b4ac8c2c3", "ja": "あたしも、新曲のサウンドは嫌いじゃないけどさ。\nこのみ姉、どこらへんがベストなんだ？", "zh": "我也不是不喜欢新歌的风格啦。\n不过，这里美姐，到底哪里算是最佳人选了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1017_039kon", "source_sha256": "127cba3127fc142d265df10242a3b016787c0ca266b12faec20de6e8a5934606", "ja": "あら。だって、志保ちゃんもジュリアちゃんも、\nセクシーユニットの経験者じゃない♪", "zh": "哎呀。因为志保和茱莉亚都是有性感组合经验的人嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ee8726b84b9ea3d4aa0828b2bf7f0165b4de0a51ccaca84e820bd623a4fe3d0", "ja": "せっ、セクシーユニット！？\n……あ、もしかして『chicAAmor』のことか？", "zh": "性、性感组合！？  \n……啊，难道你说的是『chicAAmor』？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "c2571a409a0d343be59dfb7fc27cf8bf1c62ba52aa08ae80069a4e348d92e6ee", "ja": "私は、『スコーピオ』でしょうか。\nたしかに、経験はありますけど……。", "zh": "我是“Scorpio”吗？确实，我有过相关经验……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "799dbc0d54f470d8eeb7a0dc28d5b0c0573c5ae6eed6cc4cc480ddccce2f866c", "ja": "そしてっ、セクシーの権化たるこの私！　セクシーな\nテイストの曲にこの人選は、そういう意図よね？", "zh": "还有，我可是性感的化身！让这样的阵容来唱性感\n风格的歌曲，就是这个用意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6ce7660522cddd30f8e3492b22b2cae7486db1f4bc18b0943a800c4da8337ebe", "ja": "そう……ですね！　なので、出張の際は\nこのみさんに指揮を頼もうかと……。", "zh": "是……所以，出差的时候，我想请このみ小姐来指挥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1022_039kon", "source_sha256": "29324db801530c61a6ceecf569d54179b7489853922e77ccc8df9932db6539b5", "ja": "うふふ、まかせて！　いくらでも\nお姉さんに頼っていいのよ♪", "zh": "呵呵，包在我身上！不管遇到什么事，\n都可以尽管依赖大姐姐哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "9e44b75b98026477f69034ca782347e1ff127165535efdb17bcd5a3bbe58d20a", "ja": "お願いします。メンバーは決定したし……\n今日のミーティングはこれで終わりかな。", "zh": "拜托了。成员已经决定好了……\n今天的会议就到这里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "041cba9453064dc94f9fdcf7d28e6e813e6665f862135fd5cd1646d537c72073", "ja": "それじゃあみんな、\n新曲公演に向けてよろしく頼む！", "zh": "那么大家，\n为了新歌公演，就拜托各位了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "56a77c76479426cc8b87b0d2c38d03ab95177e0fbf0a63c4866fb1417978c975", "ja": "{$P$}はさっそく出張で、美希は\n撮影か……残ったメンバーで、軽く練習でもするか？", "zh": "{$P$}立刻就要出差，美希要去\n摄影啊……剩下的成员，要稍微练习一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "ec7ebbdadf5d7500327b61f847855cddbb4782b42decc517eddeb2add6686956", "ja": "そうですね。流れだけでも、\n確認しておいたほうが……。", "zh": "是啊。至少把流程确认一下比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "3f4e7ba1c0212b585563843b5b1b7143bcbf3eabde1c3801d53573f453d7bd25", "ja": "う～ん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "5bd7a37fea28f713a9ae34f7e5efd62482e97e278e6cf34f1f1f427978ef6839", "ja": "？　あら、エレナちゃん。なんだか\n浮かない顔だけど、どうしたの？", "zh": "？啊，艾蕾娜。你看起来好像闷闷不乐的，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1029_018ele", "source_sha256": "608230c9419c8da1c0e84e525de965ad54a8ab62c8e823d2b42e5e581c9563d2", "ja": "うん。今回の新曲、ワタシはとってもステキだと\n思ったんだけど……ミキは違うのかな？", "zh": "嗯。这次的新歌，我觉得特别棒……\n但美希好像不这么觉得？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "f3bf46476281d5e7703d8c0da71a1c9b7aa6e07379b98eb0c1abcb5e54b06366", "ja": "そんなことないと思いますけど……。", "zh": "我觉得不是那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "081891e3b0b4dc777e8793553eb45351dd512ba2c8ccac28024019cd12aef1e2", "ja": "美希ちゃんのテンションが低かったのは、\n{$P$}が出張だからじゃない？", "zh": "美希的情绪之所以这么低落，\n是不是因为{$P$}要出差？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "cecf3ba6ae01f58ab9dfdf239f163cb7d0f838ef0595a282d39edee23c68d769", "ja": "そうそう。美希がバカPにべったりなのは、\nいつものことだろ？　気にするなって。", "zh": "对对。美希一直都黏着笨蛋制作人，这不是一贯如此吗？别在意啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1033_018ele", "source_sha256": "1b407f687fe55a564b4658a495692602a266922dd0430a9a61c1899831ec5424", "ja": "でもワタシ、ミキと新曲を歌うの、\nすごく楽しみだから。", "zh": "不过，我可是非常期待能和美希一起唱新歌的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1034_018ele", "source_sha256": "a7935fe31658a9507c59532a0391d96a28e72f487d9646e78d9793e8447249e0", "ja": "せっかくふたりで歌うんだもん。\nミキにも、楽しい気持ちになってほしいなって……。", "zh": "难得能两个人一起唱歌嘛。\n所以我也希望美希能感到开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "d5c3b1ea4702db5455970e6bafb258d9ff818caf462963a0a31fcf4bf93b888e", "ja": "エレナちゃん……。確かに、そのとおりね。\nそういうことなら、私たちも協力するわ！", "zh": "艾莲娜……确实如你所说。\n既然这样，我们也来帮忙吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
