{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1038_033sih", "source_sha256": "283970159ef4e7c2838ec9dcce4b5cc082bf7b08fd8c9411033e35bd71a8aef4", "ja": "エレナさんと美希さんの新曲がメインですし。\n私も、協力します。", "zh": "毕竟是以艾蕾娜和美希的新歌为主嘛。\n我也会帮忙的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
