{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_01_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "7bc86a0c49efa2d9f05fca52be874cbcfb96846814dbc6829e7b231eb18de9b4", "ja": "名付けるなら……『美希ちゃん攻略作戦』ね♪\nじゃあ今から、その作戦会議を開始しましょ！", "zh": "如果要取个名字的话……就叫“攻克美希大作战”吧♪\n那么现在，作战会议正式开始！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
